ate": "2026-10-12", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 43}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 43}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 43}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 43}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 44}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 44}, {"date": "2026-10-18", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 44}, {"date": "2026-10-19", "followers": 8, "following": 10, "tweets": 45}, {"date": "2026-10-20", "followers": 10, "following": 10, "tweets": 45}, {"date": "2026-10-21", "followers": 11, "following": 10, "tweets": 45}, {"date": "2026-10-22", "followers": 11, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-23", "followers": 12, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-24", "followers": 11, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-25", "followers": 12, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-26", "followers": 11, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-27", "followers": 10, "following": 12, "tweets": 48}, {"date": "2026-10-28", "followers": 9, "following": 12, "tweets": 49}, {"date": "2026-10-29", "followers": 9, "following": 12, "tweets": 51}, {"date": "2026-10-30", "followers": 9, "following": 12, "tweets": 53}, {"date": "2026-10-31", "followers": 9, "following": 12, "tweets": 53}], "posts": [{"id": "2115808006428606722", "text": "Negative gamma day. ES dumped 30 pts at the open.\n\nThen it hit the put wall King at 7,734. Twice. Held both times.\n\nDouble bottom on the King, ripped 19 pts back to PD https://t.co/WeiRM7HN22", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 1, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 19, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-29T14:08:33+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2115808006428606722"}, {"id": "2115803689445462400", "text": "If you read the flow, you saw this drop coming\n\nSPY opened at 767, sitting on nothing but negative gamma. −1.5B stacked at 765\n\nDealers sell into weakness. The map told you before the first candle https://t.co/S6jfBG9IX7", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 1, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 14, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-29T13:51:23+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2115803689445462400"}, {"id": "2115446330197787089", "text": "NQ dumped 190 pts from the open straight into the put wall King at 29,758. Wicked it, bounced 110\n\nThe level was on my chart before the open. Some days it really can be that easy https://t.co/zUawCSZndX", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 2, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 82, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-28T14:11:22+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2115446330197787089"}, {"id": "2113282566543515929", "text": "Rejected the King twice at 7,740.\n\nThen ES fell 50 pts straight down to PW 3 at 7,685 and stopped.\n\nNegative gamma day. When it goes, it goes. https://t.co/dYVPoRCchM", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 0, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 22, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:53:21+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2113282566543515929"}, {"id": "2113271657024401856", "text": "ES got rejected by the King twice before 10:05 AM\n\n9:35 → rejected at 7,739, flushed to the put wall\n9:47 → put wall caught it\n10:03 → back to the King, rejected again; it's like the market got sent back to its room. twice. https://t.co/YoIej8Ugxv", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 4, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 21, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:10:00+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2113271657024401856"}, {"id": "2113270248472530953", "text": "One level, two markets.\n\nES rejected the King gamma level above, and NQ followed it down. Took the short on NQ.\n\nOne trade a day is all it takes. https://t.co/PJOuTdDabC", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 3, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 32, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:04:24+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2113270248472530953"}, {"id": "2112200467921109471", "text": "Small green day\n\nES + NQ both broke and retested their King gamma levels. Long off the retest; stop under the King\n\nNot every day needs to be a home run https://t.co/0H4WewdHl6", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 5, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 36, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-19T15:13:28+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2112200467921109471"}, {"id": "2111105589430337872", "text": "Who says gamma levels don't work?\n\nNQ tagged the 29,798 King and held it, reclaimed 29,839, and ran straight into the 29,922 put wall. Three levels, three reactions, all before 10:40 AM https://t.co/aDIWoxDNzN", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 4, "retweetCount": 1, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 42, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-10-16T14:42:49+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2111105589430337872"}, {"id": "2078222700951003629", "text": "Trust the process. It always pays in due time https://t.co/j9q4qbPQp7", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 4, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 40, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-07-17T20:57:58+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2078222700951003629"}, {"id": "2077861615983096055", "text": "Two trades today.\n\nTook a -$270 on the first. Didn't chase it, didn't revenge trade. Just cut it.\n\nWaited for orderflow to give me a clean read, and the second one paid +$774.\n\nSmall losses, bigger winners. That's the model. Green day 🟢 https://t.co/ZI9mFqPwDQ", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 5, "retweetCount": 1, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 51, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-07-16T21:03:08+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2077861615983096055"}, {"id": "2022362094763708727", "text": "The importance of risk management. January was a hard month for me; it almost wiped me out. https://t.co/qN3fUa4xYg", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 3, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 31, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-02-13T17:27:51+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2022362094763708727"}, {"id": "2022362097296834652", "text": "February has been better; I'm locked in. Keeping my losses small and my winners big. That is the true essence of being a profitable trader. Don't need home runs, just consistent base hits https://t.co/hxCC6rXVDy", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 3, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 25, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "2026-02-13T17:27:52+00:00", "hashtags": [], "isRetweet": false, "url": "https://x.com/JFlotrades/status/2022362097296834652"}, {"id": "2022362106264457564", "text": "I am making a comeback, I'm ready #NQ_F https://t.co/uLMlwI8nbD", "authorName": "Jeremy F", "authorUsername": "JFlotrades", "authorAvatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008950608703684609/rtIPDXEL_normal.jpg", "authorFollowers": 9, "authorVerified": true, "likeCount": 3, "retweetCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 29, "bookmarkCount": 0, "createdAt": "20